Standard OpenPhase Input File
Nondimensionalized with W=1 and T=1. Full H24 comparison V001.

@RunTimeControl
$SimTtl   Simulation Title                          : H24 OpenPhase full comparison native
$nSteps   Number of Time Steps                      : 123463
$FTime   Output to disk every (tSteps)               : 123463
$STime   Output to screen every (tSteps)              : 123463
$dt       Initial Time Step                          : 1e-6
$LUnits   Units of length                            : W
$TUnits   Units of time                              : T
$MUnits   Units of mass                              : 1
$EUnits   Units of energy                            : 1
$nOMP     Number of OpenMP Threads                   : 1
$Restrt   Restart switch (Yes/No)                    : No
$tStart   Restart at time step                       : 0
$tRstrt   Restart output every (tSteps)              : 123463

@GridParameters
$Nx       System Size in X Direction                 : 100
$Ny       System Size in Y Direction                 : 2400
$Nz       System Size in Z Direction                 : 0
$dx       Grid Spacing                               : 0.01
$IWidth   Interface Width (in grid points)           : 8
$Resolution Grid Resolution                          : SINGLE

@Settings
$Phase_0  Name of Phase 0                            : phase0
$Phase_1  Name of Phase 1                            : phase1
$Phase_2  Name of Phase 2                            : phase2

@PhaseField
$PhaseFieldLaplacianStencil  Phase-field Laplacian stencil : ISOTROPIC
$PhaseFieldGradientStencil   Phase-field gradient stencil  : ISOTROPIC

@DrivingForce
$Average  Driving force averaging                    : No
$bUnify   Unify driving force                        : No
$Limiting Enable driving force limiting              : No

@InterfaceProperties
$EnergyModel_0_0    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_0_0          Interface energy                  : 1.0
$MobilityModel_0_0  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_0_0             Interface mobility                : 1.0
$EnergyModel_0_1    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_0_1          Interface energy                  : 1.0
$MobilityModel_0_1  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_0_1             Interface mobility                : 1.0
$EnergyModel_0_2    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_0_2          Interface energy                  : 1.0
$MobilityModel_0_2  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_0_2             Interface mobility                : 1.0
$EnergyModel_1_1    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_1_1          Interface energy                  : 1.0
$MobilityModel_1_1  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_1_1             Interface mobility               : 1.0
$EnergyModel_1_2    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_1_2          Interface energy                  : 1.5
$MobilityModel_1_2  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_1_2             Interface mobility                : 1.0
$EnergyModel_2_2    Interface energy model            : ISO
$Sigma_2_2          Interface energy                  : 1.0
$MobilityModel_2_2  Interface mobility model          : ISO
$Mu_2_2             Interface mobility                : 1.0
$TripleJunctionModel Triple-junction model             : NONE
$RegularizationFactor Regularization factor            : 1.0
$CurvatureFactor    Curvature factor                   : 1.0
$ExtrapolationMode  Energy extrapolation mode          : NONE

@InterfaceRegularization
$Average      Average curvature field                 : Yes
$Range        Averaging radius in grid points         : 4
$ClearingMode Curvature clearing mode                 : AUTOMATIC
$Threshold    Curvature threshold                     : 2.2204460492503131e-16

@BoundaryConditions
$BC0X     X axis beginning boundary condition         : NoFlux
$BCNX     X axis far end boundary condition           : NoFlux
$BC0Y     Y axis beginning boundary condition         : NoFlux
$BCNY     Y axis far end boundary condition           : NoFlux
$BC0Z     Z axis beginning boundary condition         : NoFlux
$BCNZ     Z axis far end boundary condition           : NoFlux
